+  cores ≤ main + 2%; p99 ≤ main + 5%), reported with p50 as well. Stop rule: if
+  `nat.sh` follower commands per barrier do not return to ≥ 40 within a 1 ms
+  linger, or p99 exceeds main + 5%, reject L and keep N1 as measured.
